<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 14.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 14.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   109/111   116/118     UNQ     220/221</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  114/117   120/123   225/230   245/248</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunker levels on Tuesday erode further, dispelling earlier talks that prices may bottom out soon, traders said. They said as cargo prices continued its downward trend, it is unlikely that bunker would reach a bottom soon. &quot;Look like low prices are here to stay for a while,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
